flowchart TD
    E[Retrieved evidence\ntext, source, URL, page, ID] --> API[Risk Agent API\nPOST /analyze]
    API --> I[Input validation\nPydantic schema]
    I --> P[Grounded prompt construction\nuntrusted-data instructions]
    P --> G[Gemini LLM\nstructured JSON response]
    G --> V[Response validation\nJSON + required fields]
    V --> R[Risk validation\ncategory + level + level_reason]
    R --> C[Evidence validation\nsummary/risk IDs]
    C --> O[Validated structured output\nsummary, risks, sources, disclaimer]
    O --> ORCH[Orchestrator\nfinal response + agent trace]
